          "type": "info",
          "title": "Useful patch data; live identity unverified.",
          "text": "Patch 165921 contains the additions below. Its exact relationship to the live server payload has not been established. Unchanged website datasets are not automatically verified for this patch."
        },
        {
          "id": "scope",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The stats calculator and My Tatari now support recorded account levels 1–3,600. The Horde / Goldrush calculator remains a fixed level-500 comparison. Existing values through level 2,400 match the previous export exactly."
        }
      ]
    },
