          "type": "text",
          "text": "Bonobean (UnitID 68), Titanape, Grangutan and Primakong are now integrated across My Tatari, the database, stats calculator, evolution planner, Horde guide/drafter and tierlist tools. Normal and Glitter portraits use the supplied images. Food levels 0–16, evolution trials and source-resolved regular/Horde skills are included."
