          "text": "Shuffle still grants 600 energizers. Contract Employees stay deployed, and their Tatari types are now excluded from the replacement pool. Ordinary replacement units inherit the replaced slots’ grid positions and Horde levels. Candidate selection and historical-level bookkeeping were rewritten. This does not guarantee that all replacements differ from your previous ordinary Tatari types; unusual edge cases have not been tested in a live battle."
